# DMP 1: pragmatic proof-of-concept conversion to standard RDF reification.

# Original application vocabulary and descriptive structures are retained.

# Status is on version-specific inclusion. No second version or supersession is invented.

# Conditional and compound passages remain in source descriptions; this is not a fully atomic gold standard.

# No unverified external provenance is asserted. Unassigned status does not mean Undefined.

